{
  "info": {
    "name": "Fixsure API v1",
    "description": "Fixsure keeps the customer's money as a PayPal authorization and captures it only when a photo proves the work.\n\n## Run it\n\nSet `baseUrl` (for example `http://localhost:3000`) and `staffKey`, then run the collection in order. Every other variable is filled in by the test scripts.\n\n- **Requests 1 to 13, repair loop:** sample job, hold, sample after photo, review list, similar jobs, release, final state. Includes the 401, 403, and 409 checks.\n- **Requests 14 to 23, project loop:** sample project, crew roster, project hold, crew milestone proof, crew feed, Bryntum schedule, staff approval. Includes the 403 and 409 checks.\n\n## Who can call what\n\n| Credential | Variable | Reaches |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Customer key | `customerKey`, `projectKey` | Their job: hold, cancel, milestones |\n| Technician key | `techKey` | The after photo on that repair |\n| Crew key | `crewKey` | Only milestones booked to that crew member |\n| Staff key | `staffKey` | Review, schedule, copilot, crew, approve, reject, release, void |\n\nA key that does not belong to the job returns 404.\n\n## How a milestone is released\n\n| Verification | When | Release |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `ai` | Amount up to $400 | AI check: same site, work done, confidence at least 0.82 |\n| `ai_then_human` | Amount above $400 | AI verdict recorded, a person approves |\n| `human` | Step a photo cannot prove | A person only |\n\nEach released milestone is a partial PayPal capture of its amount, then a payout to its crew member minus the platform fee. The last one is the final capture. Stopping a project voids the rest.\n\n## Design\n\nThe high-level and low-level design with diagrams are served by the app at `{{baseUrl}}/docs/design/hld` and `{{baseUrl}}/docs/design/lld`, and live in the repo under `docs/`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "staffKey",
      "value": "local-staff-key"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "customerKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "techKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "projectId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "projectKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "milestoneId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "milestoneCrewId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "crewKey",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
